eryone he knows has been  dead for over a hundred years but he is  the most worried about his house rent  which has been due for two thousand  months when miles shows interest in  returning home he is told about the  harsh world of 2173  a decade ago the world was at a nuclear  war that caused destruction mankind had  never seen millions of people died and  billions were injured cities and  countries were destroyed and a single  government took over the entire world  what once used to be new york is now  just an area between two new cities the  district they are in right now is the  southwestern united states the  information is too much for miles to  take the scientists understand this and  ask him to take a two-week rest until he  fully recovers his strength they will  have to stay low because if the  government finds out about his existence  it won't end well for all three of them  miles also finds out that an  anti-government organization called the  underground is slowly making its way up  to kill the dictator and restore peace  in society for the next few days miles  stays at the headquarters getting  accustomed to the new world of  technologies the scientists use him to  find out more about the people of the  past and their way of life one morning  while having breakfast with the  scientists he is introduced to science's  most advanced invention the servant  robots they are capable of communicating  with humans taking orders and doing all  household tasks at exponential speed  miles will be taken to the western land  in a few days when he inquires why it is  revealed that the main reason he was  revived is to be an asset to the  underground he has to help them  overthrow the government since he is the  only member of the dystopian society  without a known biometric identity hence  he is untrackable by guards miles is not  a fan of the idea and insists that he is  not the revolutionary type however he  doesn't get a chance to protest because  seconds later the hideout is surrounded  by guards sent by the government the  scientists quickly ask miles to go to  the western land and take it upon  themselves to stall the guards while he  runs away he gets on a chair chopper  that is supposed to fly him but instead  it hangs him from a tree the guards use  advanced technology to get to him but in  the end miles manages to lose them by  hiding in the back of a van it is filled  with futuristic robots and their spare  parts when the guards check the van he  sits in a corner disguised as one of the  robots the face paint doesn't do a good  job to hide the fact that he is human  but the guards assume he is an ugly  robot which works in his favor  eventually he is delivered to his owner  luna she is a 22nd century poet and  artist who lives a lavish life she  throws extravagant parties every week  and owns everything she wants in life  miles sees the news about an ancient  alien escaping from the lab and figures  out they are talking about him luna  doesn't really like his face and decides  to get it exchanged next week for now he  is asked to cook a meal for her guests  who will be here any minute back in 1973  miles was a decent cook but the new  ingredients of the future confuse him he  creates a brown explosion of pudding  that keeps on spreading on its own he  also receives the overcoats from the  guest and accidentally burns them in the  debris disposal pod while the guests  enjoy themselves the pudding grows in  size and has to be beaten to death to be  stopped then luna presents everyone with  a silver ball which is a new way of  getting high touching the ball is like  taking recreational pills miles is asked  to pass the ball to everyone which in  turn causes him to get high eventually  he starts fighting for the ball and  hugging a guest but since no one is in  their right mind they do not think much  of it luna and one of her guests get  into the orgasmatron a device that is  used to get intimate without having to  do all the work they come out a few  seconds later more relaxed than ever a  week later luna takes miles to the  nearest robot repair center to get his  head exchanged with a prettier one a  nervous miles is placed on a platform  and is seconds away from being killed  eventually he gives up the act and runs  away revealing that he is the wanted  alien the guards immediately follow him  but he gets away from them knowing that  he cannot survive the outside world on  his own he asks luna for help but she  refuses to listen to him when she tries  alerting the guards he reluctantly has  to abduct her in the following scene  luna is tied to a tree in the middle of  the woods miles takes off her gag but no  matter how loud she screams no one is  coming to save her miles explains to her  that he is not a criminal and everything  that happened was out of his control he  desperately needs to meet the people of  the underground who luna thinks are  criminals she still doesn't support him  and is eager to run away a while later  she gets hungry and demands miles get  food for her he goes looking for it on a  farm where human-sized food and  vegetables are grown strangely they are  also used to generate power after  struggling to pick the massive  strawberry for a while he returns to  luna with a piece of celery and a giant  banana at night luna calms down after  having a bite of the massive celery she  is accustomed to enjoying lavish  commodities and doesn't see the fault in  the government she pretends to be on  miles side but plans to call the police  the first chance she gets the following  day they take shelter in a stranger's  house pretending that their car broke  down luna goes to the bathroom and calls  the police who ask her to stall the  alien until they get there luna makes  miles wear a spacewalk suit and blows it  so he cannot move when the police arrive  they arrest luna first claiming that she  has been infected by the alien she  realizes that the government rules are a  joke and decides to help miles the  couple jumps into the river and deflates  the space suit that helps them escape  eventually they end up in a cave that  holds an ancient volkswagen that still  works using the vehicle they drive to  the west to meet the underground on the  way the two talk about their childhoods  and bond with each other on reaching the  destination they dump the car into a  lake before making their way to an  abandoned house at night they talk about  the vast change in the way people make  love in the past and the present luna  suggests they get inside the orgasmatron  but miles is a fan of more traditional  methods before they agree on what they  should do next the guards arrive and  arrest miles luna saves herself by  hiding inside a secret compartment in  the wall miles is taken to a  reassimilation lab where his memory will  be erased to turn him into an obedient  citizen of the regular modern society  the process of brainwashing begins by  making him think he is miss usa  2173 he is made to go against a bunch of  models and is also given a crowning  ceremony after that his sense of  identity is slowly stolen by making him  go through several tests by the end of  the week he turns into a complete modern  man who could die and kill to protect  the government's ideologies meanwhile  luna has been living in the wild for the  past week she hunts and gathers nuts for  food something she wouldn't have dreamt  of doing in her former way of life one  day while wandering through the woods a  man kidnaps her he is the leader of the  rebellious group named erno he brings  her to his camp where several rebels  like him are plotting ways to dethrone  the current dictator with them luna  learns a lot about survival and the  drawbacks of the government one day  miles walks into his room to see luna  waiting for him she has come to rescue  him but miles doesn't remember her at  all alongside her the people of the  underground have also hidden in the room  they forcefully abduct him and bring him  to the underground camp erno thinks  there is still a way to bring miles back  to his normal self by making him relive  his trauma for that they act like people  from the 19th century to make him  remember his childhood but even after  reciting an entire script of what a  typical family would say in the 90s  miles doesn't remember anything suddenly  he falls unconscious and stays like that  for a few days when he finally wakes up  he is back to his normal self luna tells  him how wonderful erno and his people  have been to her which makes miles  jealous to distract her from the leader  miles suggests they quickly attack the  dictator and fulfill their purpose they  pose as doctors of the national lab and  sneak into the building the duo is  extremely nervous which causes frequent  arguments between them but they somehow  managed to stay unnoticed miles puts his  life in danger to steal two lab coats  while dangling from a window the main  group of scientists believes miles is  the special doctor who has been recently  appointed to the facility for a specific  task they are taken to a room where they  are told what their job is it turns out  that one year ago the dictator died in  an explosion caused by protesters the  only part of him that survived was his  nose since bioengineering has developed  exponentially over the years they plan  to create an entire human out of the  nose using its cells the doctors believe  miles is the man hired to do the job  this makes the task easier for the duo  because they no longer have to kill the  dictator and only have to destroy the  nose the two sneak into the lab but find  out they are being watched by the other  doctors waiting to see the miracle  happen miles and luna know nothing about  cells and start bluffing nonsense the  others soon realize they are trying to  steal the nose and chase them but before  getting caught miles takes the nose  hostage and runs away outside he throws  it under a bulldozer ending the  dictator's life once and for all in the  end miles and luna are together ready to  return to the camp luna thinks aerno  will be a great political leader but  miles doesn't feel the same at this rate  they will be stealing erno's nose next  month because all political leaders are  horrible he asks luna to forget about  this and focus on him the movie ends as  the two share a kiss  subscribe for more videos like this turn  on notifications and leave a like to  help the channel out thank you for  watching

